sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Browser
  participant A as Apache
  participant H as .htaccess rules
  participant F as public/index.php
  participant R as Router
  participant C as Controller
  participant M as Model
  participant P as PDO/MySQL
  participant V as View/Layout
  U->>A: HTTP method + URL
  A->>H: Apply root/public rewrite and access rules
  alt static file or directory exists under public
    H-->>U: Serve asset
  else application route
    H->>F: Rewrite to index.php
    F->>F: Load config/autoloader/session; normalize project base path
    F->>R: dispatch(method, path)
    R->>C: Invoke mapped action
    C->>M: Validate/prepare business operation
    M->>P: Prepared query or transaction
    P-->>M: Rows/result
    M-->>C: Domain data/result
    C->>V: Render view with data
    V-->>U: HTML response
    opt action redirects
      C-->>U: Location + status
    end
  end
